{"title": "Lay on Hands: Cure", "pageid": 4024, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lay_on_Hands:_Cure", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lay_on_Hands_Cure.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Lay_on_Hands_Cure.webp/300px-Lay_on_Hands_Cure.webp, /w/images/c/c1/Lay_on_Hands_Cure.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Lay_on_Hands_Cure.webp/300px-Lay_on_Hands_Cure.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Lay_on_Hands_Cure.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Lay on Hands: Cure</b> is a variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a> class action <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lay_on_Hands\" title=\"Lay on Hands\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp/20px-Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp/30px-Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp/40px-Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lay on Hands\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp/20px-Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Lay_on_Hands_Greater_Healing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lay_on_Hands\" title=\"Lay on Hands\">Lay on Hands</a>. This ability allows the paladin to cure a creature of diseases and poisons.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Imbue your hands with divine power to cure all <a href=\"/wiki/Diseased_(status_group)\" title=\"Diseased (status group)\">diseases</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(status_group)\" title=\"Poisoned (status group)\">poisons</a> affecting a creature. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">No effect on undead and constructs.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>